# cargo-fuzz generated, machine-local dirs — never committed. [OPUS-4.8]
#   target/    : the fuzz crate's own build output (separate from the workspace target)
#   corpus/    : the accumulated input corpus libFuzzer grows during a run
#   artifacts/ : crash/leak/timeout reproducers libFuzzer writes on a finding
#   coverage/  : `cargo fuzz coverage` output
# Cargo.lock IS committed (it is tracked, not listed here) so CI runs are reproducible.
/target
/corpus
/artifacts
/coverage
